@page "/leagues"

<PageTitle>Leagues - CueConnect757</PageTitle>

<PageHeader Title="League Directory" Description="Find APA, BCA, USAPL, junior leagues, and in-house leagues across Hampton Roads." />

<div class="main-content">
	<p class="lead">
		Browse leagues, view schedules, and find the perfect league for your skill level and schedule.
	</p>

	<div class="content-placeholder">
		<h2>Browse Leagues</h2>
		<p>This page will feature:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>List of all active leagues in the 757/948 area</li>
			<li>Filter by league type (APA, BCA, USAPL, In-House)</li>
			<li>Filter by location and night of play</li>
			<li>League schedules and match dates</li>
			<li>Division and session information</li>
			<li>League format details (8-ball, 9-ball, mixed)</li>
			<li>Contact information and registration links</li>
			<li>Links to official league websites for rosters and detailed stats</li>
		</ul>
		<p class="note">
			<strong>League Operators:</strong> For full team rosters and detailed standings, 
			players can visit your official league website. CueConnect757 focuses on helping 
			players discover leagues and view schedules.
		</p>
	</div>
</div>

